배열을\n+// 반환하므로, framing-plan은 라벨을 찾기 전 단계에서 `通り芯ラベル未検出`을 낸다.\n describe('断面リスト pages do not produce framing grids', () => {\n   it('does not invent grids from axis-like section marks', () => {\n     const files = [\n M phases/15-plan-guard-debts/index.json\n M src/lib/import/framing-plan/elevation.test.ts\n M src/lib/import/framing-plan/parse.ts\n M tests/plan-import/parse.test.ts\n?? phases/15-plan-guard-debts/step0-codex.stderr.log\n?? phases/15-plan-guard-debts/step0-codex.stdout.log\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
